<view class="page"><view class="page-title">哪份工作，真正赚得更多？</view><view class="page-subtitle">把月薪、薪资月数和奖金放在一起比较</view><view class="offer-switch"><view class="switch-item {{activeOffer==='a'?'active':''}}" data-key="a" bindtap="switchOffer">Offer A</view><view class="switch-item {{activeOffer==='b'?'active':''}}" data-key="b" bindtap="switchOffer">Offer B</view></view><view class="card offer-form"><view class="row-between"><view class="section-title">{{activeOffer==='a'?'Offer A':'Offer B'}} 信息</view><text class="tag">税后估算</text></view><view class="field-label top-label">税前月薪（元）</view><input class="field-input" type="digit" value="{{current.gross}}" data-field="gross" bindinput="onInput"/><view class="field-row top-fields"><view class="field-col"><view class="field-label">薪资月数</view><input class="field-input" type="digit" value="{{current.months}}" data-field="months" bindinput="onInput"/></view><view class="field-col"><view class="field-label">年终奖（元）</view><input class="field-input" type="digit" value="{{current.bonus}}" data-field="bonus" bindinput="onInput"/></view></view><view class="field-row top-fields"><view class="field-col"><view class="field-label">公积金比例 %</view><view class="field-input offer-select" bindtap="openHousingPicker"><text>{{housingRates[current.housingIndex]}}%</text><text class="select-chevron">⌄</text></view></view><view class="field-col"><view class="field-label">工作城市</view><view class="field-input offer-select" bindtap="openCityPicker"><text class="select-city">{{cities[current.cityIndex]}}</text><text class="select-chevron">⌄</text></view></view></view><button class="secondary-btn calc-btn" bindtap="compare">对比两份 Offer</button></view><view wx:if="{{comparison}}" class="section"><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">年度收入对比</view><text class="tag">估算</text></view><view class="card"><view class="compare-total"><view class="compare-col"><view class="muted small">Offer A 年度到手</view><view class="compare-money">¥{{comparison.aNet}}</view></view><view class="compare-col"><view class="muted small">Offer B 年度到手</view><view class="compare-money">¥{{comparison.bNet}}</view></view></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="row-between"><text class="muted">年度到手差额</text><text class="difference">{{comparison.diffSign}}¥{{comparison.diff}}</text></view><view class="winner">{{comparison.winner}}</view><view class="muted small result-note">奖金按简化方式并入年度收入，实际税额可能因计税方式及个人扣除不同而变化。</view></view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-title">比较建议</view><view class="tip-card"><view class="tip-icon">↗</view><view><view class="tip-title">别只看月薪</view><view class="tip-desc">薪资月数、年终奖、社保基数和公积金都会影响实际收入。</view></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{pickerVisible}}" class="selector-mask" bindtap="closePicker"><view class="selector-sheet" catchtap="stopPropagation"><view class="sheet-handle"></view><view class="sheet-heading"><view><view class="sheet-title">{{pickerTitle}}</view><view class="sheet-subtitle">为 {{activeOffer==='a'?'Offer A':'Offer B'}} 选择估算参数</view></view><view class="sheet-close" bindtap="closePicker">×</view></view><view class="option-list"><view wx:for="{{pickerOptions}}" wx:key="index" class="option-item {{(pickerType==='city' && index===current.cityIndex) || (pickerType==='housing' && index===current.housingIndex)?'option-selected':''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="chooseSelector"><view class="option-label">{{item}}{{pickerType==='housing'?'%':''}}</view><view wx:if="{{(pickerType==='city' && index===current.cityIndex) || (pickerType==='housing' && index===current.housingIndex)}}" class="option-check">✓</view></view></view><view class="sheet-footnote">Offer 对比采用估算参数，实际缴纳规则请以当地政策为准。</view></view></view></view>